---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="学习路线"><div class="container page"><p class="eyebrow">Paths</p><h1>嵌入式学习路线</h1><p class="intro">先完成公共主干，再根据目标选择方向。路线展示长期地图，只有真实内容节点才提供学习入口。</p><div class="legend"><span class="tag verified">● 可学习</span><span class="tag">◐ 建设中</span><span class="tag">○ 已规划</span></div><section><h2>公共主干</h2><div class="stages"><article class="stage active"><b>F1 · 编程基础</b><p>C 语言、数据表示、内存与缓冲区。</p><span>建设中</span></article>{['F2 · 硬件基础','F3 · MCU 与通信','F4 · 工程能力'].map((stage)=><article class="stage"><b>{stage}</b><p>随 UART 纵向切片逐步验证并开放。</p><span>已规划</span></article>)}</div></section><section><h2>方向分支</h2><div class="branches">{['A · MCU / RTOS','B · Linux 应用','C · BSP / 驱动','D · 网络 / IoT'].map((branch)=><article class="stage"><b>{branch}</b><p>公共主干完成后选择，不提前建设空课程。</p><span>已规划</span></article>)}</div></section></div></BaseLayout>
<style>.page{padding-block:3rem}.page h1{margin:.5rem 0}.intro{max-width:46rem;color:var(--color-text-muted)}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem;margin:1.5rem 0 3rem}.stages,.branches{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:.75rem}.stage{padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:var(--radius-md);background:var(--color-surface)}.stage.active{background:var(--color-surface-subtle)}.stage p,.stage span{color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.875rem}.stage span{font-weight:600}@media(max-width:64rem){.stages,.branches{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}@media(max-width:40rem){.stages,.branches{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
